---
mm: 1.2
kind: module
name: widget-rp2040-mcu
module: platform.widget_rp2040.mcu
use: mm.mcu
file: mcu.cppm
file: pins.cpp
option: buildable-host no
---

# platform.widget_rp2040.mcu

widget-rp2040's implementation of mm.mcu. Its pins.cpp implementation unit
keeps the board's pin assignment inside the same named module, so the provider
needs neither a global C-linkage symbol nor a shared header.
